# Mobile UX

- One-hand primary actions; touch targets ≥ 44pt; respect Safe Area.
- Keep BottomNav patterns; overlays use portal + overlay lock (never under nav).
- Prefer existing DS classes: `.ds-page-title`, `.btn-primary` / `.btn-secondary` / `.btn-danger`, cards, `SearchInput`.
- Lucide icons only — no emoji UI.
- Do not turn mobile flows into dense desktop dashboards.
- Full rules: `.cursor/rules/preventivai-design-system.mdc`.
